WEBVTT

00:12:57.779 --> 00:13:00.064
you don't feel that
they were getting exploited,

00:13:00.088 --> 00:13:03.779
so much as they were making
voluntary sacrifices out of passion?

00:13:04.429 --> 00:13:05.748
DF: I don't think so.

00:13:06.478 --> 00:13:08.869
Look, that's a tricky one,

00:13:08.893 --> 00:13:13.499
because I had a very particular
view of the business,

00:13:13.523 --> 00:13:15.466
given my scope and my domain.

00:13:16.559 --> 00:13:19.625
There were a lot of different roles.

00:13:21.611 --> 00:13:23.152
I didn't work in the buildings.

00:13:23.176 --> 00:13:25.573
Most of the folks that I lead and managed

00:13:25.597 --> 00:13:28.955
and interacted with on a regular basis
were within the office,

00:13:28.979 --> 00:13:34.222
and they had a bit more